# 02 - Fading RGB LED

## Objective

Flash multiple colors one at a time on a single RGB LED.

## Components Used

- ESP32
- RGB LED
- 3 220 Ω resistor
- Breadboard
- Jumper wires

## Concepts

- RGB values
- pinMode()
- PWM
- delay()
- variables

## Wiring

- Red pin → GPIO 5 (through a 220 Ω resistor)
- LED Cathode → GND
- Red pin → GPIO 19 (through a 220 Ω resistor)
- Red pin → GPIO 21 (through a 220 Ω resistor)

## Expected Result

The RGB LED shows the colors blue, green. red, yellow, cyan, and purple for 1 second.

## What I Learned

- RGB values
- PWM 

## Resources

- ESP32 Documentation
- Arduino Documentation
